stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Interest under s.7Q - cannot be deferred" as INTEREST {
        [*] --> FORECAST: L1 due date passes unpaid
        FORECAST --> ASSESSED: L2 Due Deposit Balance Summary captured
        ASSESSED --> IN_CHALLAN: L3 challan generated with the contribution
        IN_CHALLAN --> PAID: L4 receipt captured
        PAID --> [*]
    }
    state "Damages under s.14B - payable now or later" as DAMAGES {
        [*] --> OPEN: L5 portal shows damages
        OPEN --> OPEN: L6 employer defers, choice recorded
        OPEN --> DAMAGES_IN_CHALLAN: L7 employer chooses to pay
        DAMAGES_IN_CHALLAN --> DAMAGES_PAID: L8 receipt captured
        DAMAGES_PAID --> [*]
    }

    note right of FORECAST
      The engine forecasts, the portal governs.
      A difference is a reconciling item, never an overwrite.
    end note

    note right of OPEN
      Open damages never fail a gate.
      They stay on every later gate view.
    end note
